Build-Depends: dpkg-dev (>= 1.19), make, python3
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: fx607-gpe02-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 3.0), make, gcc, kmod, systemd, init-system-helpers
Recommends: linux-headers-amd64 | linux-headers-generic
Description: experimental ASUS FX607VJ BIOS 340 lid wake workaround
 Packages module source for DKMS. Arms GPE02 for wake only on ASUS FX607VJ
 with BIOS FX607VJ.340. Lid wake was validated on one Ubuntu machine;
 other kernels, power-button wake and keyboard wake remain unvalidated.
 Installation builds the module but does not load it or enable its service.
 Matching kernel headers are required on the installation target.
